Package: SBayesOmics
Type: Package
Title: Simulation of GWAS and Molecular QTL Data
Version: 0.1.2.9000
Authors@R: person("Shouye", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "syliu.cn@foxmail.com")
Description: Tools for simulating GWAS and molecular QTL phenotypes, summary
    statistics and known genetic effects, constructing gene-SNP maps, reading
    molecular LD references and adjusting summary-statistic sample sizes.
